    {
      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nLGTM. The [dev minimum](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/0af2d85193a9ece3d95e61375ebbe7a6d89164e7/pyproject.toml#L98) and [locked version](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/0af2d85193a9ece3d95e61375ebbe7a6d89164e7/uv.lock#L3594-L3617) agree, and the existing platform guard is preserved. I found no qualifying issues in the light review, including the affected installation paths and existing ModelOpt coverage.\n\nStatic review only: I didn't run uv checks or GPU tests, or independently verify the remote wheel's hash and metadata.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:3b5888204bbd567cf26f8029378b6a4976dacb24afad7dd9186215f6a7ca4443:7347a13c141525aaa392997408bbe28b8f5d96d8ebfb28632520accd44d71ba6 -->",
